{5}{You're just in time, my good fellow. I just made a fresh pot of tea. And, oh! Dear me, where's my manners? My name is Weqia. Weqia Rurrae. And please, come over here and join me.... I'm sorry, what did you say your name was again?}{You're just in time, dearie. I just made a fresh pot of tea. And, oh! Dear me, where's my manners? My name is Weqia. Weqia Rurrae. And please, come over here and join me.... I'm sorry, what did you say your name was again?}{}{}{}{lf1 1}
{6}{My name is @PCNAME@, and I'd like some tea but I really only have a moment.}{}{5}{}{9}{}
{7}{Me called @PCName@, and tea sounds good but me only have a moment.}{}{-4}{}{9}{}
{8}{}{}{}{}{}{}
{9}{Oh, stuff and bother! People today - Always in a hurry! There's always time for a little tea. That's what my late husband Rastus, rest his soul, used to say. Besides, I get so few visitors these days, what with Rosie laid up with gout and Neria moving away. These days, just about the only ones who come to see me are wanting a new carpet and they always seem to be in a hurry to leave.}{Oh, stuff and bother! People today - Always in a hurry! There's always time for a little tea. That's what my late husband Rastus, rest his soul, used to say. Besides, I get so few visitors these days, what with Rosie laid up with gout and Neria moving away. These days, just about the only ones who come to see me are wanting a new carpet and they always seem to be in a hurry to leave.}{}{}{}{}
{10}{So you make these beautiful carpets do you?}{}{5}{}{13}{}
{11}{Pretty rugs. You make dees?}{}{-4}{}{13}{}
{12}{}{}{}{}{}{}
{13}{I certainly do. Let's see now - Oh! I have some sweetcakes we can have with our tea, and here's some apple pie, and I still some chicken. It's from last night, but still good. And here's some huckleberry jam.}{I certainly do. Let's see now - Oh! I have some sweetcakes we can have with our tea, and here's some apple pie, and I still some chicken. It's from last night, but still good. And here's some huckleberry jam.}{}{}{}{}
{14}{Just tea, thank you.}{}{5}{}{17}{}
{15}{Just tea, thanks.}{}{-4}{}{17}{}
{16}{}{}{}{}{}{}
{17}{Well, the tea is ready. Come, come! You look as if you've done a bit of traveling. I'd love to hear about your adventures.}{Well, the tea is ready. Come, come! You look as if you've done a bit of traveling. I'd love to hear about your adventures.}{}{}{}{}
{18}{Well I ....}{}{1}{}{-2}{}
{19}{...and then the ram's horn got caught on his trouser pocket and ripped them clean off! Hee! Hee! Hee! There he was, naked as a jaybird, hanging onto the ram's hindlegs, and wouldn't you know it? Mrs. Pingle came walking by at that moment! Hee! Hee! Hee!}{...and then the ram's horn got caught on his trouser pocket and ripped them clean off! Hee! Hee! Hee! There he was, naked as a jaybird, hanging onto the ram's hindlegs, and wouldn't you know it? Mrs. Pingle came walking by at that moment! Hee! Hee! Hee!}{}{}{}{}
