{150}{Oh, of course I do. Mr. Furbottom owns it. He owns most of the south and west farthings these days. But, and don't take this the wrong way, but you're not one of us. What would you want with a hobbit-hole?}{Oh, of course I do. Mr. Furbottom owns it. He owns most of the south and west farthings these days. But, and don't take this the wrong way, but you're not one of us. What would you want with a hobbit-hole?}{}{}{}{}
