{154}{I would hope that you wouldn't want to live there. What with the low ceilings and all. You'd have to wear a helmet all day long! Hee! Hee!}{I would hope that you wouldn't want to live there. What with the low ceilings and all. You'd have to wear a helmet all day long! Hee! Hee!}{}{}{}{}
