{186}{Sure. He's probably at his place in the south farthings. Tobacco harvest time, you know. [ She notices the blank look in your eyes.] It's the south-west corner of town, by the river. Not the one at the bridge, but the big place behind that.}{Sure. He's probably at his place in the south farthings. Tobacco harvest time, you know. [ She notices the blank look in your eyes.] It's the south-west corner of town, by the river. Not the one at the bridge, but the big place behind that.}{}{}{}{gf 2813 1}
