{253}{[She smiles.] I can't tell you how relieved I am to hear that. Brandybuck is a shire, you know. But come, come! We have to celebrate. I've got a kettle full of water, some fresh tea leaves, and I was doing some baking yesterday, so we have all kinds of breads and pastries. Oh, and Granny Smith brought me a whole bushel of her apples.}{[She smiles.] I can't tell you how relieved I am to hear that. Brandybuck is a shire, you know. But come, come! We have to celebrate. I've got a kettle full of water, some fresh tea leaves, and I was doing some baking yesterday, so we have all kinds of breads and pastries. Oh, and Granny Smith brought me a whole bushel of her apples.}{}{}{}{}
